  m_Text: "I. CORE COPYRIGHT\n\n\n\xA9 2026 Dopas. All Rights Reserved.\n\n\nDeveloped
    by Dopas (Sole Developer)\n\n\nUses Unity\xAE technology.\n\n\n***\n\n\nII. THIRD-PARTY
