    STORE EULA\n\n\nAll assets listed below are licensed under the Standard Unity
    Asset Store EULA. Special thanks to the asset creators.\n\n\n1. Goldmetal\n\n\n-
    Undead Survivor Asset Pack\n\n\n- Top-down 2D RPG Asset Pack\n\n\n\n\n\n2. Unity
    Technologies\n\n\n- UI Samples\n\n\n\n\n\n3. leohpaz (Sound Asset)\n\n\n- RPG
    Essentials Sound Effects - FREE!\n\n\n\n\n\n4. GAPH (Particle Asset)\n\n\n- 48
    Particle Effects Package\n\n\n\n\n\n5. Hovl Studio (Particle Asset)\n\n\n- Magic
    Effects FREE\n\n\n\n\n\n6. Fenerax Studios (Joystick Asset)\n\n\n- Joystick Pack\n\n\n\n\n\n7.
    Gabriel Aguiar Prod (Effect Asset)\n\n\n- Free Quick Effects Vol. 1\n\n\n\n\n\n8.
    karsiori (Chest Asset)\n\n\n- Pixel Chests Pack - Animated\n\n\n\n\n\n9. alkakrab
    (BGM - Title)\n\n\n- Free 6 Dark Fantasy Boss Battle Tracks\n\n\n(Track: Whispers
    of the Abyss)\n\n\n\n\n\n10. RavenmoreArt (ICON Asset)\n\n\n- Painterly Fantasy
    Icon Pack\n\n\n---\n\n\n\n\n\nB. ASSETS LICENSED UNDER OTHER TERMS\n\n\nThese
    assets are used under their specified licenses, requiring direct attribution.\n\n\n\n\n\n**1.
    Boss: Demon Slime**\n\n\n- **Creator:** chierit\n\n\n- **License:** Creative
